---

---

<section
  id="founders"
  class="bg-background py-[130px] scroll-mt-[90px] border-b border-hairline max-[760px]:py-[75px]"
>
  <div class="shell">
    <!-- Header Area -->
    <div
      class="reveal flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-[800px] mx-auto mb-[80px]"
    >
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[9px] tracking-widest uppercase font-bold text-accent mb-6 clay-pressed">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block size-[6px] rotate-45 bg-accent"></span>
          Our team
        </div>
      <h2 class="display-lg mb-4 text-balance">
        Dependable finance support<br />
        <span class="text-foreground/60">that feels like your own team</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[1.1rem] text-muted-foreground font-light tracking-wide">
        A new standard of capacity powered by decades of experience
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Two Column Content -->
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_1.3fr] gap-[80px] items-center max-[1050px]:gap-[50px] max-[900px]:grid-cols-1 max-[900px]:gap-[60px]"
    >
      <!-- Left Column: Text -->
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-6" style="animation-delay: 140ms">
        
        <!-- Icon -->
        <div class="size-[56px] clay-btn rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-accent">
          <svg
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M12 20h9"></path>
            <path d="M16.5 3.5a2.12 2.12 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[1.05rem] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          Calveris Global has spent years helping businesses and accountancy
          firms manage their growth. Along the way, we've had hundreds of
          conversations with founders and partners, and one thing always comes
          up: you need dependable capacity to deliver great work.
        </p>

        <p class="text-[1.05rem] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          The problem? Recruitment delays, admin overload, impersonal
          communication, and a lack of visibility on the everyday finances.
        </p>

        <p class="text-[1.05rem] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          So we built something better. We combine hands-on accounting
          experience with personal ownership to give you a team that actually
          understands how you work. It's not an outsourced add-on; it's a
          purpose-built finance function designed to fit right in.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/teams" class="group inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full clay-btn uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[11px] font-bold text-foreground hover:clay-pressed hover:text-accent transition-all duration-300">
            <span>Meet our team</span>
            <span class="transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="size-3.5" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 8h11M9.5 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Image & Badges -->
      <div class="reveal relative group w-full" style="animation-delay: 280ms">
        <!-- Physical Clay Frame -->
        <div class="clay-card rounded-[2.5rem] p-4 sm:p-6 pb-28 sm:pb-32 w-full relative">
          
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] relative aspect-[4/3] w-full shadow-[inset_0_4px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]">
            <img
              src="/images/team.jpg"
              alt="Calveris Global Team"
              loading="lazy"
              class="block w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1200ms] group-hover:scale-[1.025]"
            />
          </div>

          <!-- Badges Overlay (Pressed into the bottom clay frame) -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 sm:bottom-10 left-0 right-0 px-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 w-full">
            <div class="clay-pressed px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">
              5+ years experience
            </div>

            <div class="clay-pressed px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">
              UK & US coverage
            </div>

            <div class="clay-pressed px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">
              Built by accountants
            </div>

            <div class="clay-pressed px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-accent">
              Dependable delivery
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .clay-card {
    box-shadow: 20px 20px 40px #c4c6cc, -20px -20px 40px #ffffff;
    background: var(--color-background);
  }

  .clay-btn {
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 16px #c4c6cc, -8px -8px 16px #ffffff;
    background: var(--color-background);
  }

  .clay-pressed {
    box-shadow: inset 6px 6px 12px #c4c6cc, inset -6px -6px 12px #ffffff;
    background: var(--color-background);
  }
</style>
